msgid "CTEST_SCRIPT_DIRECTORY"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../variable/CTEST_SCRIPT_DIRECTORY.rst:4
msgid ""
"The directory component of the path to the top-level CTest script specified "
"by the :option:`ctest -S` option.  It is given as it appears in that path, "
"so it may be relative."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../variable/CTEST_SCRIPT_DIRECTORY.rst:8
msgid ""
"The file name part is available in :variable:`CTEST_SCRIPT_NAME`.  The "
"concept is similar to :variable:`CMAKE_CURRENT_LIST_DIR`."
msgstr ""
